{
 "_doc": [
  "Every city that existed when the county map was expanded in 2027-08,",
  "frozen to the county it was already published under.",
  "",
  "A city with no pin hashes into its area's county list, so ADDING a county",
  "to an existing area silently re-deals every unpinned city in it -- the",
  "gazetteer, the districts named after a dominant county, and every archived",
  "season that referenced them would all move at once. Freezing what has",
  "already been published means the map can keep growing and nothing that",
  "exists ever moves. New cities hash as before, among all of their area's",
  "counties.",
  "",
  "Generated from records/orgs/cities.json; append to it, never rewrite it."
